      "text": "get(key = 10)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "5nON5KNhEHFo5fJMbySLx",
      "originalText": "get(key = 10)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0oO3dhB0m1fAtHg4uY11Z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2738.012081347498,
      "y": 98.61772951251044,
      "width": 497.31628488962303,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 357162847,
      "version": 425,
      "versionNonce": 222841329,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791549087301,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "key is hashed and then\nwhatever is the first node\nafter the hash on the ring,\nwe get the value from that",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "key is hashed and then whatever is the first node\nafter the hash on the ring, we get the value from that",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KdpuhLjna3dkGAVMEJbbc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3239.4463230656247,
      "y": 673.336769218532,
      "width": 2038.823486328125,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1869084479,
      "version": 829,
      "versionNonce": 1076485489,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791549861170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "better way is to try to fetch from cache, if it isn't there, fetch from DB and then update cache.\nif the value is updated in the DB from client or elsewhere, update cache internally than let client directly update it.\nthis may have a brief period of invalidation, so if we find that entry dirty, we can serve from db until that value\nis updated. this all is based on tradeoffs on if you want eventual consistency or strict consistency.\nIf there's a thundering herd problem of cache miss, have a MQ in between cache and DB and request collapsing\nto serve one response from DB to multiple same requests\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "better way is to try to fetch from cache, if it isn't there, fetch from DB and then update cache.\nif the value is updated in the DB from client or elsewhere, update cache internally than let client directly update it.\nthis may have a brief period of invalidation, so if we find that entry dirty, we can serve from db until that value\nis updated. this all is based on tradeoffs on if you want eventual consistency or strict consistency.\nIf there's a thundering herd problem of cache miss, have a MQ in between cache and DB and request collapsing\nto serve one response from DB to multiple same requests\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
